{
  "head": 1.0217,
  "lines": [
    "Quick one.",
    "Your card machine company",
    "has to tell you",
    "when you can walk away.",
    "Did they?",
    "Since January 2023,",
    "the regulator caps a terminal lease",
    "at 18 months.",
    "Not three years,",
    "not four.",
    "And when that term ends,",
    "the big providers must write to you.",
    "The date it ends",
    "and a nudge to shop around.",
    "After that, it rolls monthly.",
    "One month's notice",
    "and you're out.",
    "Now, if your deal's decent,",
    "ignore all this.",
    "Plenty are.",
    "But find that letter,",
    "check the date.",
    "It's your call,",
    "not theirs.",
    "We're NeroPay,",
    "card machines from Manchester.",
    "Follow us for more of this",
    "and have a look at",
    "neropay.app."
  ]
}
